# GHOSTWRITE AI - The Haunted Storyteller

GHOSTWRITE AI is an AI-powered storytelling web application that generates horror stories from user prompts. It features a haunted interface, an interactive terminal, and a Memory Garden for saving favorite stories.

## Features
- AI horror story generation
- Interactive haunted terminal
- Memory Garden to save stories
- Copy and download stories
- Responsive design

## Technologies Used
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- Ollama with an open-weight AI model (if configured)

## How to Run
1. Clone this repository.
2. Open the project folder in VS Code.
3. Open `index.html` using Live Server.
4. Start exploring the application.

Note: AI story generation requires a configured AI backend.

## Project Goal
This project explores the combination of artificial intelligence, creative storytelling, and interactive web design through the theme "Ghost in the Machine."

## Development
Built with assistance from ChatGPT.

